#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:1
#: 0ecbe047ebab4bbc85c7e9f0ff0d2bc7
msgid "NEP 数据集查看（NEP Dataset Display）"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:3
#: 1355d2ec2ff246b883eaa1ff4ecc49c8
msgid "`NEP 数据集查看` 是用来查看、筛选和导出结构数据的页面。它有两类常见用途："
msgstr ""
"`NEP Dataset Display` is the workspace for inspecting, selecting, and "
"exporting structure data. It supports two common stages of a dataset "
"workflow:"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:5
#: 7d042effd32e40c38b74724ccf1d0dcc
msgid "**DFT 之前**：把 `构建数据集` 生成的候选结构导入进来，先删掉明显异常结构，再采样去 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"**Before DFT**: import candidates generated by `Make Dataset`, remove "
"clearly anomalous structures, and then sample a subset for DFT."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:6
#: 33b5fa5091b041bca95eaa4a3a7b3186
msgid "**训练之后**：导入训练结构和模型输出，找误差大的结构，判断下一轮数据应该补哪里。"
msgstr ""
"**After training**: load the training structures and model output, locate"
" high-error structures, and decide which region needs more data in the "
"next iteration."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:8
#: 281198935b9c4759a52f9e5e7a06db68
msgid "它不是训练器，也不替代 DFT。这里的重点是把结构和图上的异常点连起来，让你能快速决定： 保留、删除、导出，还是回到上游重新生成。"
msgstr ""
"It is not a trainer and does not replace DFT. Its job is to connect "
"points in a plot with their actual structures so that you can decide "
"whether to keep, remove, export, or regenerate them upstream."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22
#: 49cb7386aa404b26bfd2d1f6c9c45224
msgid "NEP 数据集查看总览"
msgstr "NEP Dataset Display overview"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:22
