#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:37
#: 6a85b3816b6d497aaa74f549462a318e
msgid "入口是顶部 `打开`。如果只是看一批候选结构，直接打开 `xyz` 文件；如果要回看完整训练结果， 打开包含训练输出的目录或对应文件。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Open` in the title bar. Open an `xyz` file to inspect a candidate "
"collection. Open the training-output directory or the relevant output "
"file when reviewing a complete training run."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:40
#: beef58fb29a9406882793836f8408f52
msgid "第一次应该看哪里"
msgstr "What to inspect first"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:42
#: dc6a03c1c09f4b19b7283d14bdf9ee03
msgid "先看三个区域："
msgstr "Start with these three areas:"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:44
#: 93dbc142f66e418d955d1484ced1238d
msgid "**误差图或分布图**：先找离群点，不要一上来逐个翻结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Error or distribution plots**: locate outliers before browsing "
"structures one by one."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:45
#: 3533a3e4cf2b4f589281f2cb9a332414
msgid "**结构视图**：点中图上的结构后，看右侧是否有过近原子、不合理配位、奇怪表面或异常磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"**Structure view**: select a point, then check the structure on the right"
" for atoms that are too close, unreasonable coordination, unintended "
"surfaces, or unusual magnetic moments."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:46
#: 01330981fff44c388ab97bb1e8fdfc27
#
msgid ""
"**状态行**：关注 `原始 / 当前 / 删 / 选 / "
"坏`，确认当前删掉、选中和保留的数量；鼠标停在状态栏上会显示包括未选中数量在内的完整说明。"
msgstr "**Status line**: use `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Rej` to confirm how many structures are retained, removed, selected, or marked bad; hover over it for a full breakdown, including the unselected count."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:48
#: eeb4d573376c47298ca0dcc310e77ee2
msgid ""
"如果你正在处理 `构建数据集` 的候选结构，建议先看完整流程： [候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT](../workflows/clean-"
"candidate-structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"If you are processing candidates from `Make Dataset`, read the complete "
"workflow first: [Clean candidate structures before DFT](../workflows"
"/clean-candidate-structures.md)."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:51
#: a4405a4d337443b598797a5ecc7270b0
msgid "从这里打开训练集评估"
msgstr "Open Training Set Audit from this page"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:53
#: da5453e7e2e9420dbf374b38de94b19c
msgid "加载数据后，点击左侧图表工具栏中的 `训练集评估`。软件会检查当前活动结构，并进入「训练集评估」的概览页。"
msgstr ""
"After loading data, click `Training Set Audit` in the plot toolbar on the"
" left. NepTrainKit audits the active structures and opens the Training "
"Set Audit overview."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:55
#: 98940e42be18465d829ed0ba70af2362
msgid ""
"如果只想查看能量、力、virial、预测值或误差的分布，可以在训练集评估中切到「数据地图 → 数据分布」，点击柱形分箱后仍可把对应结构选回 "
"`NEP 数据集查看`。"
msgstr ""
"To inspect only the distribution of energy, force, virial, predictions, "
"or errors, switch to `Data map → Explore distributions` in Training Set "
"Audit. Selecting a histogram bin can still send the matching structures "
"back to `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:57
#: 923d07c7c7704bf1aeec2b27df58dd92
msgid ""
"训练集评估还可以按精确组分查看结构数量，并对全部结构分析 FCC、HCP、BCC、L1₂、Laves 相结构，以及 FM、AFM、FiM、PM-"
"like 等 `spin:R:3` 磁类型。完整用法、判据、占比视图和限制见 [训练集评估](training-set-"
"assessment.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Training Set Audit also groups structures by exact composition and "
"analyzes FCC, HCP, BCC, L1₂, and Laves structural phases together with "
"`spin:R:3` magnetic types such as FM, AFM, FiM, and PM-like. See "
"[Training Set Audit](training-set-assessment.md) for the workflow, "
"criteria, share views, and limitations."

