#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:78
#: def9f4baba6b4ae1bbda66140e23da35
msgid ""
"如果你不知道按钮图标对应哪个功能，直接展开本页左侧目录。目录按照软件页面从上到下排列： "
"顶部数据入口、左侧主图区、右侧结构区、筛选栏、底部状态栏。参数解释和执行结果都放在对应功能下面。"
msgstr ""
"If you do not recognize a button icon, expand the table of contents on "
"the left. It follows the page from top to bottom: data inputs, the main "
"plot, the structure view, the filter bar, and the status bar. Each tool's"
" parameters and results are documented below it."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:81
#: 6cc39096a55d4e10999c1a51925e0662
msgid "候选结构清洗时怎么用"
msgstr "Clean a candidate pool"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:83
#: 9d202ee78e6a4eeeb6245d653f21ce82
msgid "候选结构清洗的重点不是追求预测精度，而是先剔除明显坏样本："
msgstr ""
"The purpose of candidate cleaning is not to maximize prediction accuracy."
" It is to remove clearly bad samples before they consume DFT resources:"

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:85
#: a2e562942c71470daf085bd65a1a5944
msgid "打开 `构建数据集` 导出的候选结构。"
msgstr "Open the candidate structures exported by `Make Dataset`."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:86
#: ba3bff9574164397a13f69918843ae8f
msgid "用结构视图和 `查找非物理结构` 找几何异常。"
msgstr ""
"Use the structure view and `Find non-physical structures` to find "
"geometric anomalies."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:87
#: f23cbe7dd3ae4d5dbe589427141b9436
msgid "如果有可用 NEP 模型，再看预测力、能量或分布长尾。"
msgstr ""
"If a usable NEP model is available, inspect predicted forces, energies, "
"and long distribution tails."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:88
#: e7179770de3a40ae9336d82f9f590a13
msgid "选中异常结构后删除，或单独导出做记录。"
msgstr ""
"Delete selected problematic structures or export them separately for "
"investigation."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:89
#: 91fd1c7fbc524e69adfcec1fdfe8d487
msgid "导出清洗后的候选池，再做 FPS 或其他代表性采样。"
msgstr ""
"Export the cleaned candidate pool, then apply FPS or another "
"representative-sampling method."

#: ../../source/module/NEP-dataset-display.md:91
#: 763d934f534347e4b3a832f76322d87d
msgid "这里要避免一个顺序错误：不要把未清洗的候选池直接交给 FPS。FPS 只看描述符距离， 坏结构可能因为“离得远”被选中。"
msgstr ""
"Do not send an uncleaned candidate pool directly to FPS. FPS measures "
"descriptor distance; a bad structure can be selected precisely because it"
" lies far from the rest of the pool."

