msgid "判断时不要只看一个总 RMSE。更有用的是确认误差集中在哪类结构： 缺陷、表面、应变、高能构型、某个元素组合，还是某个生成卡片的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Do not stop at a single aggregate RMSE. Determine where the error is "
"concentrated: defects, surfaces, strained cells, high-energy structures, "
"a particular element combination, or output from a particular generation "
"card."

